# Development only. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored); `npm run dev` reads it.
# The installed app does NOT read a `.env` — there, add the key in
# Settings → AI (Gemini), where it is stored encrypted for your Windows account.
#
# Read only by the Electron main process; never exposed to the renderer.
# When set, this takes precedence over a key saved in Settings.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional. Overrides the default model (gemini-3.5-flash-lite), e.g. when
# Google retires a model for your key and the API answers 404.
# GEMINI_MODEL=
